--!nocheck
--[=[
	ExeUI — a WindUI-style GUI library with the Exe 6 admin panel design language.

	Extracted design system:
	  • Dark panel look (#1B1B1B window / #222222 screen / #272727 cards)
	  • Pill-shaped controls with gradient "specular" strokes
	  • Exponential tweens (0.5s / 0.3s) like the original
	  • Lucide icons (open source, https://lucide.dev) instead of the Exe icons
	  • Original Exe 6 slice/shadow assets + UI sounds

	Usage:
	  local ExeUI = require(path.to.ExeUI)
	  local Window = ExeUI:CreateWindow({ Title = "My Panel" })
	  local Tab = Window:Tab({ Title = "Home", Icon = "house" })
	  Tab:Button({ Title = "Hello", Callback = function() end })

	See README.md for the full documentation.
]=]

